2026-07-27T11:28:22.7495083Z i /tmp/RtmpLW2XFt/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:28:22.7495512Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:28:22.7496011Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:28:22.7496451Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:28:22.7497104Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:28:22.7498340Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:28:22.7499341Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
